  "notes": [
    "Periods: Early 1807-1808, Middle 1809-1811, Late 1812-1814.",
    "Combined Grenadiers/Voltigeurs: the Grenadier/Carabinier or Voltigeur companies from Line and Light battalions in a brigade can be pooled into a separate Combined battalion, addable to any Infantry Brigade.",
    "Foreign Formations: upgrades and downgrades in the Infantry Brigade selection can represent the Swiss, Irish, Hanoverian, Nassau, Baden, Hesse-Darmstadt and Legion de Midi troop types.",
    "This builder omits the book's many point-modifier upgrades/downgrades (Veteran status, Tough Fighters, Large, Small, Unreliable, etc.) — apply these manually per the book when finalising a list.",
    "Named commanders have no official points cost in this supplement — priced here at the generic Divisional Commander cost for their Staff Rating; adjust freely."
  ]
}
